{"availability":"available","full":"hoangsonww/ClipChronicle-Cross-Platform-App","name":"ClipChronicle-Cross-Platform-App","description":"📋 An open-source, AI-powered multi-platform Electron clipboard manager with local-first storage, blazing-fast search, and productivity-boosting features. Includes an Electron desktop app, Chrome extension, and interactive Next.js landing site - all fully customizable.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":20,"forks":9,"created":"2025-06-23T01:57:44Z","updated":"2026-09-27T19:39:14Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://clipchronicle.vercel.app","topics":["amazon-web-services","ansible","aws","chrome-extension","consul","docker","electron","gcp","material-ui","nextjs","playwright","react","reactjs","rust","sqlite","tailwindcss","terraform","typescript","vault","vercel"],"demo":"https://clipchronicle.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:16.007Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:16.007Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:16.007Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T06:29:16.007Z","stars":20,"forks":9}],"technologies":["React","Next.js","Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["ClipChronicle - your clipboard’s second brain","An AI-powered, local-first clipboard manager that captures, organizes, and recalls every snippet across desktop and browser - completely offline. Time to make your clipboard great again!","ClipChronicle is designed to be the ultimate clipboard companion, addressing the limitations of traditional clipboard managers:"],"features":["Not being able to see what you copied – Traditional clipboard managers often only show the last copied item, making it hard to find older snippets.","Lack of organization – Many clipboard managers lack robust tagging or folder systems, leading to chaos as your history grows.","Limited search capabilities – Searching through clipboard history can be slow and imprecise, especially with large datasets.","Cannot update/delete copied items – Once something is copied, it’s often set in stone, making it hard to correct mistakes or update information.","No AI assistance – Most clipboard managers do not leverage AI to enhance productivity, such as summarizing or translating snippets."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hoangsonww/ClipChronicle-Cross-Platform-App/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"5e3e5c743962bd32f37e816577ba336ea3140ae67982b1693a4e125f5b2c12c0","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:16.167Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:16.167Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"ClipChronicle - your clipboard’s second brain","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hoangsonww/ClipChronicle-Cross-Platform-App/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"5e3e5c743962bd32f37e816577ba336ea3140ae67982b1693a4e125f5b2c12c0","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hoangsonww/ClipChronicle-Cross-Platform-App/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:16.168Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-27T19:39:14Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hoangsonww/ClipChronicle-Cross-Platform-App/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:16.170Z","hash":"5e3e5c743962bd32f37e816577ba336ea3140ae67982b1693a4e125f5b2c12c0","originalBytes":22143,"storedBytes":22143,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:16.007Z","subjects":["Browser extensions & PWAs"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Design","subjects":["Browser extensions & PWAs"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Browser extensions & PWAs","source":"metadata","match":"Chrome extension"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Automation & workflows","Apple","Data & dashboards","Writing & documents","Privacy & security"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://clipchronicle.vercel.app/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-12T06:43:47.04